:: Robin Chocolate Widgets [widget]

<<widget "robinChocolateOfferHelp">>
	<<if ["helped", "sabotaged"].includes($balloonStand.robin.status) and $balloonStand.robin.talked is false and $robin.timer.customer is 0>>
		<<balloonRobinTalk>>
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Tell Robin the truth|Balloon Robin Check-In]]>><<endevent>><<set $phase to ("confess_"+$balloonStand.robin.status)>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Stay silent|Balloon Robin Check-In]]>><<endevent>><<set $phase to ("quiet_"+$balloonStand.robin.status)>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<!-- Note: Don't try to move the <<endevent>> outside these links, that would make this widget less portable. -->
		<<if setup.inflation.canAfford(200)>>
			<<foodicon "cocoa">><<link [[Buy hot chocolate (0:15 <<printprice 200>>)|Robin Chocolate Purchase]]>><<stress -6>><<trauma -1>><<pass 15>><<clotheson>><<endevent>><</link>><<lstress>><<ltrauma>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
		<<robinicon "cocoa">><<link [[Offer help (0:30)|Robin Chocolate Help]]>><<endevent>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><<npcincr Robin trauma -1>><<pass 30>><<clotheson>><<run robinStandRecordHelp()>><</link>><<glove>><<lrtrauma>>
		<br>
		<<if $robin.timer.hurt is 0 and !$robinbreakupCooldown and $passage isnot "Robin Stand Business">>
			<<highicon>><<link [[Discuss the stand (0:05)|Robin Stand Business]]>><<endevent>><<set $robinStandVenue to "park">><<pass 5>><<clotheson>><</link>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
		<br>
		<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Park]]>><<endevent>><<clotheson>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

:: Robin Chocolate
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "park">><<effects>>
<<npc Robin>><<person1>>

<<if $robinchocolateintro isnot 1>>
	<<set $robinchocolateintro to 1>><<set $daily.robin.freeDrink to 1>>

	Robin waves when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> stirs a steaming pot with <<his>> other hand, the little stand wrapped in the smell of warm milk and cocoa. 
	<br><br>
	"Hey," <<he>> says. "People don't buy much lemonade when it's so cold. I'm selling hot chocolate instead. Here." <<He>> measures cocoa powder and sugar into a mug, pours in some hot milk, then stirs it before passing it to you with both hands.
	<br><br>
	The mug warms your fingers as you take a sip. It's very sweet.<<lstress>><<stress -6>>
<<else>>
	You see Robin <<if $robin.stayup isnot 2>>standing<<else>>nodding off<</if>> behind <<his>> hot chocolate stand, wrapped up against the cold. A pot of hot chocolate sits on the stove, and you can smell cocoa as you approach. 
	<br><br>
	<<print $robin.timer.hurt gte 1 or $robinbreakupCooldown ? "<<He>> glances away when <<he>> sees you." : C.npc.Robin.trauma gte 40 ? "<<He>> flinches whenever somebody passes <<him>>. When <<he>> sees you, <<he>> gives a timid wave." : $robin.stayup is 2 ? "<<He>> startles awake when you approach <<him>>." : "<<He>> waves when <<he>> sees you.">>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<robinStandNotice>>
<<robinChocolateOfferHelp>>

:: Robin Chocolate Purchase
<<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<set _robinDrinkCost to setup.inflation.spendPrice(200)>>
<<money -200>>
<<wearProp "hot cocoa">>
<<if Weather.bodyTemperature lte 39.0>><<set Weather.bodyTemperature to Weather.bodyTemperature + 1.0>><</if>>

"<<print $robin.timer.hurt gte 1 or $robinbreakupCooldown ? "I guess." : "Sure!">> One hot chocolate, coming right up!" Robin says, turning to warm up the milk.
<br><br>

You slide <<printmoney _robinDrinkCost>> across the counter. When the drink is ready, Robin passes you the mug. It is hot enough that you have to adjust your grip until it cools a little.
<br><br>

<<if $robin.timer.hurt gte 1 or $robinbreakupCooldown>>
	<<set $robinmoney += 2>>
	<<balloonRobinAngryPurchase>>

<<elseif $robinpaid is 1 and $daily.robin.freeDrink isnot 1>>
	<<set $daily.robin.freeDrink to 1>>
	<<if $robinStand?.selfSufficient is 1>>
		"Partners drink free," <<he>> says, sliding the money back across the counter with a grin. "House rules. I made them up just now."
	<<else>>
		"I-I can't take this from you..." <<he>> says, sliding the money back across the counter to you. "You're already paying Bailey for me. Besides, I'd just end up giving it back to you."
	<</if>>
	<<money _robinDrinkCost "robinDrinkRefund">>

<<elseif $robinpaid is 1>>
	<<set $robinmoney += 2>>
	"I... do have to take it from you this time," <<he>> says, frowning as <<he>> looks down at the money. "I have to pay for the powder and milk. I can't keep giving it away, even if I want to."

<<else>>
	<<set $robinmoney += 2>>
	"Thanks for your purchase!" <<he>> says with a smile, putting the money somewhere under the counter.

<</if>>
<br><br>

You take your time with the mug, letting it warm your hands as you sip away at the hot chocolate. The sweetness clings to your tongue, and the cold seems a little further away.
<br><br>

"<<print either(
"...Have you ever watched the sky on a clear night? There's so many stars out there... So many worlds just like ours. ...It might be a little too cold for that now, though.",
"...Do you think Bailey will ever be gone? There has to be someone powerful out there who hates <<nnpc_him Bailey>>, right?",
"It's hard to keep the stand running some days. But it's worth it in the end.")>>"
<br><br>

<<if Time.hour gte 17>>
	"It's getting nippy out," Robin says. "Could you help me carry my stuff home?"
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Accept (0:30)|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><<pass 30>><<clotheson>><</link>><<glove>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Refuse|Park]]>><<clotheson>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>

<<else>>
	<<robinChocolateOfferHelp>>

<</if>>

:: Robin Chocolate Help
<<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<set _robin to statusCheck("Robin")>>
<<effects>>
<<if pcAreArmsBound("any")>>
	<<He>> looks at your arms. "Oh. You can't help like that. Here." <<He>> walks behind you, and undoes your bindings with deft hands.<<unbind>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<if Time.hour gte 17>>
	<<if _robin.trauma gte 40>>
		"I think I want to go home," Robin says, shivering. "This is too much right now."
	<<else>>
		"I'd like help carrying my stuff home," Robin says. "It's getting nippy."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	You walk with Robin back to the orphanage.
	<br><br>

	<<if $pleasure gte $pleasuremax>>
		You're almost back when the pleasure becomes too much to hold back. Your steps falter as you orgasm.
		<<orgasm>>
		Robin quickly looks away, though <<his>> face reddens.<<npcincr Robin lust 1>>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
	<<endevent>>
	<<link [[Next|Orphanage]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $robin.timer.hurt gte 1 or $robinbreakupCooldown>>
	<<balloonRobinAngryHelp>>
	<<robinChocolateOfferHelp>>
<<else>>
	<<He>> smiles.
	<<if $rng gte 81 and (effectiveTransformationLevel("cow") gte 6) and $livestock.intro isnot undefined>>
		<<if _robin.trauma gte 40>>
			"I think I'm okay right now, but could you please stay with me?" Robin asks you while rubbing <<his>> hands together.
		<<else>>
			"I have everything I need. You're welcome to stay though. I would like the company."
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		You keep Robin company while <<he>> runs the stand, and chat with <<him>> while there are no customers.
		<<npcincr Robin love 1>><<glove>><<ltrauma>><<lstress>><<trauma -3>><<stress -6>>
		<br><br>

		<<generate2>><<person2>>
		A <<person>> approaches the stand.
		<<if _robin.trauma gte 40>>
			"Hi," Robin says, looking down. "T-two pounds for chocolate if that's okay."
		<<else>>
			"Welcome," Robin says. "Two pounds for a warm mug of chocolate."
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		"Sure, sweetie," the <<person>> says before turning to you. <<His>> eyes move over your body before <<he>> smiles. "I remember you. From the farm. Why don't you come with me? I'll bring you home." <<He>> holds <<his>> hand out.
		<br><br>
		You freeze with your hand halfway up and pull it back against your chest. A few seconds pass before you take one step towards the stranger, then reach for <<his>> hand with shaking fingers.
		<<if _robin.dom gte 60>>
			<br><br>
			<<link [[Next|Robin Chocolate Cow]]>><</link>>
			<br>

		<<else>>
			"E-Excuse me, <<sir>>," Robin interrupts. "Your hot chocolate."
			<br><br>
			The <<person>> looks surprised, but <<his>> smile doesn't fade. "Thanks, sweetheart," <<he>> says, taking the offered mug. "Keep a close eye on your friend." <<He>> walks away.
			<br><br>
			The other customers leave you alone. Robin keeps glancing towards the path the stranger took, with one hand resting on the edge of the stand. After several minutes, <<he>> finally turns back to the customers.
			<br><br>

			<<robinChocolateOfferHelp>>
		<</if>>
	<<elseif $rng gte 61>>
		"I'd like to give out free samples. Could you take this tray around the park, and offer them to anyone who looks cold? I hope it's not too heavy."
		<<wearProp "tray">>
		<<if _robin.trauma gte 40>>
			<<He>> pauses before handing you the tray. "Hurry back please," <<he>> adds in a quiet voice.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<speechresolve>>
		<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
			"I-I can do that," you say, taking the tray with both hands. "I'll be careful."
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "polite">>
			"Of course," you say. "I'll tell them where they can buy more."
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant">>
			"Of course," you say, lifting the tray. "I'll send them straight back to you for seconds."
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
			"Yes," you say. "I'll come straight back when the tray is empty."
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
			"Fine," you say, taking the tray. "They'd better appreciate the free drink."
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
			"Fine," you say. "Anyone who complains can go without."
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
			"Leave it to me," you say, taking the tray. "Keep the next batch ready."
		<<else>>
			"Sure," you say. "I'll be back soon."
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		You carry the tray along the park paths. People stop as you pass, and you hand out the mugs one at a time while pointing them towards Robin's stand.
		<<set $robinmoney += Math.round(5 * (1 + (($beauty / 5000) + (fameTotal() / 2000))))>>
		<<generate2>><<person2>>

		<<if dangerEvent()>>
			<br><br>
			A <<person>> creeps up behind you,
			<<if wornSetupClothes("lower").skirt is 1>>
				<span class="purple">and grasps the hem of your skirt.</span>
			<<elseif $worn.lower.set isnot $worn.upper.set>>
				<span class="purple">and grasps the hem of your $worn.lower.name.</span>
			<<else>>
				<span class="purple">and grasps your <<breasts>>.</span>
			<</if>>
			<<gstress>><<stress 6>>
			<br><br>

			You could stop <<him>>, but your hands are occupied by the awkward tray.
			<br><br>

			<<link [[Shove|Robin Chocolate Slap]]>><<def 1>><</link>><<dancedifficulty 1 1000>>
			<br>
			<<link [[Endure|Robin Chocolate Endure]]>><<sub 1>><<trauma 6>><<stress 6>><</link>><<gtrauma>><<gstress>>
			<br>
		<<else>>
			<<famebusiness 1>>
			<<rng 5>>
			<<switch $rng>>
				<<case 1>> Passing a bus stop is enough to empty half the tray.
				<<case 2>> A red-nosed <<father>> is particularly grateful for two mugs. <<He>> calls <<his>> children down from a tree and gives them one each.
				<<case 3>> A homeless <<personsimple>> takes one, and warms <<his>> hands against the mug.
				<<case 4>> A <<person>> grabs one as <<he>> jogs past, and drinks it without slowing.
				<<case 5>> A lot of people weren't prepared for the cold.
			<</switch>>
			<br><br>
			<<if isInPark("doren") and !$weekly.dorenchocolatebuy and random(0,50) gte 25>>
				<<set $weekly.dorenchocolatebuy to true>><<set _dorenjustbought to true>>
				<<npc "Doren" 3>><<person3>>
				"Hiya, <<lassie>>!" Doren says, taking a cup and looking towards the stand. "Helping Robin out, eh?"
				<br><br>
				<<He>> turns to the group behind <<him>>; you recognise River among them. "Oi, see that chocolate stand over there? My treat!"
				<br><br>
				The group walks over and forms a line in front of Robin's stand.
				<br><br>
				"See ya, <<lassie>>," Doren says before joining them.
				<br><br>
				<<set $robinmoney += 30>>
			<</if>>
			<<person1>>
			Robin smiles when you return to <<him>>.
			<<if _robin.trauma gte 40>>
				<<He>> hugs you the moment you place the tray down. "Thank you."
			<<else>>
				"Business has improved a lot," <<he>> says. "Thank you."
				<<if _dorenjustbought is true>>
					<br><br>
					<<He>> shows you <<his>> recent profits, "Look! Doren just came by and treated a bunch of people to a cup!"
				<</if>>
			<</if>>
			<br><br>
			<<robinStandNudeLink "park">>
			<<robinChocolateOfferHelp>>
		<</if>>
	<<elseif $rng gte 41 and Weather.isSnow>>
		<<if _robin.trauma gte 40>>
			"I think I'm okay right now, but could you please stay with me?" Robin asks you while rubbing <<his>> hands together.
		<<else>>
			"I have everything I need. You're welcome to stay though. I would like the company."
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		You keep Robin company while <<he>> runs the stand, and chat with <<him>> while there are no customers.
		<<npcincr Robin love 1>><<glove>><<ltrauma>><<lstress>><<trauma -3>><<stress -6>>
		<br><br>

		<<if dangerEvent() and !$daily.robin.parkSnow>>
			<<set $daily.robin.parkSnow to 1>>
			A snowball hurtles through the air, scattering powder from its loose edge.
			<<if _robin.trauma gte 40>>
				Robin sees the snowball but freezes, only managing to flinch before <<hes>> hit with a faceful of snow. You duck and pull <<him>> down.
				<br><br>
				Robin wipes the snow from <<his>> face and shivers. "Let's just w-wait," <<he>> says. "They'll leave us alone eventually."
			<<else>>
				Robin ducks just in time, then pulls you down by the arm. Another snowball soars overhead and bursts against the stand cloth. You hear laughter from behind the trees.
				<br><br>
				"They'll get bored and leave," Robin says, sitting on the snow and keeping close to the stand. "We just need to be patient."
			<</if>>
			<br><br>
			<<link [[Wait|Robin Chocolate Wait]]>><</link>>
			<br>
			<<link [[Challenge the leader|Robin Chocolate Challenge]]>><</link>>
			<br>
			<<link [[Take them all on|Robin Chocolate Take]]>><</link>>
			<br>
			<<if $robinromance is 1 or $robinsexfriend is 1>>
				<<link [[Make out|Robin Chocolate Kiss]]>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><<npcincr Robin lust 1>><</link>><<promiscuous1>><<glove>><<glust>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
		<<else>>
			<<robinStandCompanyEvent "park">>
		<</if>>
	<<elseif $rng gte 21 and isInPark("doren") and !$weekly.dorenchocolatebuy>>
		<<set $dorenhotchocoprice to 40 + Math.floor(Math.random()*31)*2>>
		<<set $dorenhotchocoamount to $dorenhotchocoprice/2>>

		<<set $weekly.dorenchocolatebuy to true>>
		<<npc "Doren" 2>><<person2>>
		Doren stops by the stall. "Good <<= Time.hour lt 12 ? "morning" : "afternoon">>. I know this is a tall order, but could you make me $dorenhotchocoamount cups of hot chocolate? I'm planning to give them out to the homeless." <<he>> hands Robin £$dorenhotchocoprice.
		<br><br>
		Robin shakes <<person1>><<his>> head, returning the money to Doren. "If it's for people in need, then I'll give them for free—"
		<br><br>
		"No, no, Robin. I'll pay." Doren insists firmly.
		<br><br>
		<<print '<<link [[Offer to pay for the hot chocolate (£'+$dorenhotchocoprice+')|Hot Chocolate Doren]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>'>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Convince Robin|Hot Chocolate Doren]]>><<set $phase to 2>><<npcincr Doren love 1>><</link>><<glove Doren>> /*Doren's love */
		<br>
		<<link [[Support Robin's point|Hot Chocolate Doren]]>><<set $phase to 3>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><</link>><<glove Robin>> /*Robin's love */
	<<else>>
		<<if _robin.trauma gte 40>>
			"I need some more milk. I'm sorry. I know it's heavy, but could you buy some more?" <<He>> shivers even through <<his>> warm attire. "Harvest Street has some." <<He>> hands you £5 and a large bottle. "That should be enough."
		<<else>>
			"I need to start heating another pot of milk. I don't like asking because it's heavy, but could you buy some more? You'll need to go to Harvest Street for the fresh stuff." <<He>> hands you £5 and a large bottle. "That should be enough to fill it."
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<speechresolve>>
		<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
			"O-Okay," you say, taking the bottle and money. "I'll bring the milk back."
		<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
			"Of course," you say, accepting the money and bottle. "I'll be careful with it."
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
			"Yes," you say, taking the bottle with both hands. "I'll bring the bottle back full."
		<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
			"You owe me for carrying this," you say, though you take the bottle anyway.
		<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
			"I'll get it," you say, taking the bottle. "Keep the stove going."
		<<else>>
			"All right," you say, taking the bottle and money.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<if $settings.breastFeedingEnabled and $lactating is 1 and hasSexStat("promiscuity", 3) and $awareness gte 100>>
			As you pass the toilets, you look down at the empty bottle. You could fill it with your own breast milk instead of walking to Harvest Street.
			<br><br>

			<<link [[Milk yourself|Robin Milk Masturbation]]>><<set $masturbationstart to 1>><</link>><<promiscuous3>>
			<br>
		<<else>>
			You leave the park, and follow the road to Harvest Street.
			<br><br>
		<</if>>
		<<link [[Buy the milk|Robin Milk Buy]]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 400>>
		<<link [[Steal the milk|Robin Milk Steal]]>><<crimeUp 5 "petty">><</link>><<skulduggerydifficulty>><<crime "petty">>
		<br>
		<<if hasSexStat("promiscuity", 2)>>
			<<link [[Flirt for cheaper milk|Robin Milk Seduction]]>><<endevent>><</link>><<promiscuous2>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>


:: Robin Chocolate Set
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<effects>>
<<set _robin to statusCheck("Robin")>>

<<if pcAreArmsBound("any")>>
	<<He>> looks at your arms. "Oh. You can't help like that. Here." <<He>> walks behind you, and undoes your bindings with deft hands.<<unbind>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>
You help Robin carry <<his>> equipment to the park. "Thank you for the help," <<he>> says.
<<if _robin.trauma gte 40>>
	"I don't know what I'd do if I was by myself."
<<else>>
	"It's hard carrying it all on my own."
<</if>>
<<He>> lights <<his>> portable stove.
<br><br>
<<robinChocolateOfferHelp>>

:: Robin Chocolate Set Tutorial
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
You and Robin leave for the park. You are walking a little ahead, carrying some of <<his>> equipment. Just as you leave the orphanage with Robin you bump into a <<endevent>><<generate1>><<person1>><<person>> passing by. The clash causes you to drop what you are holding.
<<He>> staggers back and looks at you with anger, but <<his>> rage turns to lechery as <<he>> beholds you. "You're the cutest thing I've seen all week! Come 'ere."
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Tutorial]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><<set $tutorialExit to "Robin Chocolate Set Tutorial 2">><</link>>

:: Robin Chocolate Set Tutorial 2
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<effects>>
<<npc Robin>><<person1>>
Robin spots you exiting the alley. "A-Are you okay?" <<he>> asks, with a worried expression. "They didn't hurt you, did they?"
<br><br>
<<speechresolve>>
<<if _speechAttitudeResolved is "meek">>
	"I'm okay," you say, rubbing your fingers over one sleeve. "I think."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy">>
	"I-I'm okay," you say, looking down as you reach for the dropped equipment.
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"I'm all right," you say. "Sorry for worrying you."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	"I'm all right," you say, picking up one of Robin's bags. "Let's keep going."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	"I'm fine," you say, brushing dirt from your clothes. "Next time they should keep their hands to themselves."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	"I'm fine," you say. "If they try that again, I'll hurt them."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"I'm fine," you say, straightening your clothes. "Let's get the rest of this stuff to the park."
<<else>>
	"I'm okay," you say.
<</if>>
<br><br>
Together, you gather anything still lying on the ground. Once Robin has <<his>> equipment again, you continue to the park beside <<him>>.
<br><br>
<<robinChocolateOfferHelp>>


:: Robin Chocolate Cow
<<effects>>
<<set _robin to statusCheck("Robin")>>

Just before you take the <<persons>> hand, Robin catches your wrist and pulls you back. <<person1>><<He>> steps between you and the stranger.
<<if _robin.trauma gte 40>>
	"Y-you're not taking <<phim "Robin">>!" <<he>> says, handing the <<person2>><<person>> <<his>> cup with a shaky hand.
<<else>>
	"I need to ask you to leave," <<he>> says, handing the <<person2>><<person>> <<his>> cup.
<</if>>
<br><br>

"Careful, <<nnpc_gendery "Robin">>," the <<person2>><<person>> says. "Your friend is worth a lot. I'd hate to see you wind up like <<phim stranger>>."
<br><br>

<<if _robin.trauma gte 40>>
	Robin flinches, but holds <<nnpc_his "Robin">> ground. "Leave before I call the police."
<<else>>
	Robin frowns. "I'm asking you to leave one last time before I call the police."
<</if>>
<br><br>

The <<person>> laughs and pours the chocolate into the snow. "Keep the money. Better keep an eye on your friend." <<He>> leaves.
<br><br>

You turn to Robin and give a quiet moo, still looking towards the path the stranger took.
<br><br>

<<if _robin.trauma gte 40>>
	"Everything's okay," Robin says. "Here."
<<else>>
	"It's okay," Robin says. "Here."
<</if>>
<<person1>><<He>> pours another mug of hot chocolate, stirs it, then places it in your hands.
<br><br>

"This should make you feel better." <<Hes>> right.<<gdom>><<npcincr Robin dom 1>><<lstress>><<stress -6>>
<br><br>

The next few customers buy their drinks and leave without bothering you.
<br><br>

<<robinChocolateOfferHelp>>

:: Robin Chocolate Slap
<<effects>>
<<set _robin to statusCheck("Robin")>>

You toss the tray upward, turn towards the <<person>>, and slap <<him>> across the face. <<He>> stumbles on the icy ground and falls on <<his>> ass.<<ltrauma>><<trauma -6>>
<br><br>
<<if $danceSuccess>>
