:: Robin Chocolate Patient
<<effects>>

The delinquents turn towards you, but you throw before they are ready. Your first snowball hits a <<person2>><<person>> in the face. <<He>> steps back, slips on the ice, and falls while <<his>> friends spread out.
<br><br>

You move behind a hedge before they can throw back. While they search for you, you pack another snowball and move along the hedge. When one of them turns away, you lean out and hit a <<person3>><<person>> in the side of the head.
<br><br>

The others turn and throw several snowballs towards the hedge.
<<if $danceSuccess>>
